OL,3,GNEWSAWelsh club wins best rugby kitchen
OL,4,Aprize - and a year's supply of chips
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Welsh club has won the UK's Rugby
OL,7,FKitchen of the Year, beating hundreds
OL,8,Fof entrants to claim top spot.
OL,10,FCaernarfon Rugby Club's Keith Parry
OL,11,Fsaid the news came as a "shock" but was
OL,12,F"fantastic" - especially the year's
OL,13,Fsupply of chips that is part of the
OL,14,Fprize.
OL,16,FThe award celebrates the unsung heroes
OL,17,Fwho help behind the scenes and fuel
OL,18,Fplayers and supporters every match day.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
