OL,3,GNEWSAWelsh club wins best rugby kitchen
OL,4,Aprize - and a year's supply of chips
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe award panel included a mix of
OL,7,Ffamous chefs and rugby stars, but
OL,8,Fworld-famous French chef and former
OL,9,Frugby player Pierre Koffmann was given
OL,10,Fthe deciding vote.
